<div class="slide-container">
  <div>
    <div class="slide-badge">Chapter 5 • User Interface</div>
    <div class="slide-title">Blender Sidebar Inspection Dashboard</div>
  </div>
  <div class="slide-body">
    
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 30pt; margin-top: 14pt;">
          <div style="flex: 1;">
            <h3 style="color: #007acc; font-size: 16pt;">Industrial Surface Inspector Panel</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 6pt;">
              Embedded directly in Blender's 3D Viewport Sidebar (<code>N</code> key -> <strong>Surface Inspector</strong>):
            </p>
            <ol style="font-size: 11.5pt; line-height: 1.7; margin-top: 8pt;">
              <li><strong>Direction Controls:</strong> Continuous X, Y, Z vector sliders.</li>
              <li><strong>Quick Presets:</strong> One-click buttons (+X, -X, +Y, -Y, +Z, -Z, ISO).</li>
              <li><strong>Align with Camera:</strong> Grabs active viewport camera direction.</li>
              <li><strong>Threshold Slider:</strong> Real-time tolerance adjustment with live formulas.</li>
              <li><strong>One-Click Actions:</strong> Run Inspection, Toggle Arrows, Restore Materials, Reset.</li>
              <li><strong>CSV Report:</strong> One-click quality control report export.</li>
            </ol>
          </div>
          <div style="flex: 1; background: #1e293b; color: #f8fafc; padding: 16pt; border-radius: 8pt; font-family: monospace; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5;">
